### Both — fan-out routes (served by the AiDotNet host)
# These drive BOTH frameworks from one call and return the two responses side by side.
# Start BOTH hosts before calling:
#   terminal 1 (aidotnet-benchmarks):  dotnet run -c Release
#   terminal 2 (pytorch-benchmarks):   python -m uvicorn pytorch_benchmarks.api:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
#
# Self-signed dev cert — VS Code REST Client: set "rest-client.verifySSL": false.

############################################################
# Benchmark fan-out
############################################################
# /api/Both/Benchmark calls THIS host's /api/Benchmark/Models (via the request's
# own scheme/host) and the PyTorch host at http://localhost:8000, sequentially.

@host = https://localhost:7001

### Run the four-model benchmark on both frameworks (no body) — minutes per side
POST {{host}}/api/Both/Benchmark?models=mlp,cnn,lstm,transformer

### Quick single-model fan-out
POST {{host}}/api/Both/Benchmark?models=mlp

############################################################
# Regression fan-out
############################################################
# IMPORTANT: /api/Both/SimpleRegression forwards to a HARDCODED AiDotNet endpoint
# at https://localhost:50724 (and PyTorch at http://localhost:8000). Start the
# AiDotNet host on that port for this route:
#   dotnet run -c Release --urls https://localhost:50724
@bothHost = https://localhost:50724

### SimpleRegression on both frameworks (Simple/SmallSet)
POST {{bothHost}}/api/Both/SimpleRegression?UseGPU=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BothBoundary

------BothBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="features"; filename="features.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Simple/SmallSet/features.csv
------BothBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tests"; filename="tests.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Simple/SmallSet/tests.csv
------BothBoundary--

### SimpleRegression on both frameworks (Complex/SmallSet)
POST {{bothHost}}/api/Both/SimpleRegression?UseGPU=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BothBoundary

------BothBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="features"; filename="features.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Complex/SmallSet/features.csv
------BothBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tests"; filename="tests.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../TestData/RegressionTestData/Complex/SmallSet/tests.csv
------BothBoundary--
